@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 个人资料更新时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/个人资料页\n(Profile.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "后端控制器\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
database "UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI: 编辑昵称/邮箱/头像URL
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/auth/profile\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n{ displayName, email, avatarUrl }
Axios -> AuthCtrl: PUT /auth/profile
note over Axios
请求拦截器自动附加 Authorization
end note
AuthCtrl -> Jwt: extractUsername(token)
AuthCtrl -> DB: findByUsername(username)
DB --> AuthCtrl: User
AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: updateUserProfile(user with changes)
UserSvc -> DB: 保存
AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message: 个人信息更新成功 }
Axios --> UI: 显示成功
UI -> Axios: GET /api/auth/userinfo 以刷新本地资料

note over AuthCtrl
接口：PUT /api/auth/profile
end note

@enduml

